## Overview
A comprehensive real-time event management system for "Secrets of Rudraksha" exhibition events. Features include visitor registration with OTP, consultation token booking, QR code management, expert queue management, real-time WebSocket updates, and complete admin CRM with analytics.

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: React 19.2 with TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v3, React Router, Socket.io Client, html5-qrcode, QRCode.js, html2canvas, Axios
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express 5.2.1, Prisma ORM, MySQL 3.16.2, Socket.io, JWT, bcrypt, Zod, Morgan, Helmet

## System Architecture

### Database Schema (Prisma Models)
```typescript
// Event - Main event configuration
model Event {
  id String @id
  slug String @unique
  name String

  users User[]
  registrations VisitorRegistration[]
  tokens TokenBooking[]
  consultations ConsultationSession[]
  sales SalesAssistance[]
}

// Visitor - Registered event attendee
model VisitorRegistration {
  id String @id
  name String
  phone String @unique
  otp String?
  verified Boolean
  event Event @relation(fields: [eventId])
}

// TokenBooking - Consultation queue token
model TokenBooking {
  id String @id
  number String // Token #101, #102, etc.
  status "ISSUED" | "CALLED" | "COMPLETED" | "MISSED"
  visitor VisitorRegistration @relation(fields: [visitorId])
}
```

