## Loyalty Program System

### Data Models (Prisma Schema)
```prisma
model LoyaltyCustomer {
  id String @id
  shop String
  customerGid String // Shopify customer ID
  pointsBalance Int @default(0)
  tier String // "Sadhak", "MahaSadhak", "Yogi", "MahaYogi", "SiddhaYogi"
  lifetimeEarned Int @default(0)

  ledgers LoyaltyLedger[]
  redemptions LoyaltyRedemption[]
}

model LoyaltyLedger {
  id String @id
  customer LoyaltyCustomer @relation(fields: [customerId])
  customerId String
  type "EARN" | "REDEEM" | "REVERSE"
  amount Int
  reason String // "purchase", "signup", "review", etc.
}
```

