### Key Features

#### 1. Real-Time Webhook Order Processing
```typescript
async function handleOrderCreate(webhook) {
  const order = webhook.payload;
  const customer = order.customer;

  // Check for redemptions
  const redeemableVariants = order.line_items.filter(item => isRedeemableVariant(item.variant_id));

  if (redeemableVariants.length > 0) {
    const pointsToDeduct = calculateRedemptionPoints(redeemableVariants);

    await LoyaltyLedger.create({
      customerId: customer.id,
      type: 'REDEEM',
      amount: pointsToDeduct,
      reference: order.id,
    });
  }

  // Award purchase points
  const pointsEarned = Math.floor(order.total_price / 10);

  await LoyaltyLedger.create({
    customerId: customer.id,
    type: 'EARN',
    amount: pointsEarned,
    reason: 'purchase',
  });

  // Sync to Shopify metafield
  await updateCustomerMetafield(customer.id, {
    'nepa_loyalty.points_balance': customer.pointsBalance,
  });
}
```

#### 2. Shopify Metafield Integration
```typescript
const metafieldUpdateMutation = `
  mutation UpdateCustomerMetafield($input: CustomerInput!) {
    customerUpdate(input: $input) {
      customer {
        id
        metafields(first: 10) {
          edges { node { namespace key value } }
        }
      }
    }
  }
`;
```

#### 3. Discount Code Generation
```typescript
const generateCode = () => `NR-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 8).toUpperCase()}`;

async function issueRewardCode(shop, customerGid, rewardVariantGid) {
  const code = generateCode();

  const createDiscountMutation = `
    mutation CreateProductDiscount($input: DiscountCodeBasicInput!) {
      discountCodeBasicCreate(input: $input) {
        discountCodeBasic { discountCode { code } }
      }
    }
  `;

  await admin.graphql(createDiscountMutation, {
    variables: {
      input: {
        code: code,
        title: `Rudraksha Reward`,
        customerGets: {
          value: { percentage: 1.0 },
          items: { productVariants: { add: [rewardVariantGid] } }
        }
      }
    }
  });

  return { code, variantGid: rewardVariantGid };
}
```

## Overview
Backend integration for WhatsApp Business API messaging, inbox management, and communication workflows. Handles incoming/outgoing messages, media processing, and conversation threading.

## Tech Stack
- **Language:** JavaScript (99.8%)
- **Runtime:** Node.js
- **Framework:** Express.js
- **Additional:** WhatsApp Business API SDK

## Core Functionality
- Message sending/receiving
- Media file handling (images, documents, audio)
- Contact/conversation management
- Webhook handling for incoming messages
- Message templating

## Key Components

### 1. Message Handler
```javascript
app.post('/webhook/messages', (req, res) => {
  const messages = req.body.entry?.[0]?.changes?.[0]?.value?.messages || [];

  for (const message of messages) {
    const from = message.from;
    const timestamp = message.timestamp;

    if (message.type === 'text') {
      handleTextMessage(from, message.text.body, timestamp);
    } else if (message.type === 'image') {
      handleImageMessage(from, message.image, timestamp);
    }
  }

  res.status(200).send('OK');
});
```

### 2. Send Message
```javascript
async function sendMessage(phoneNumber, message, mediaUrl = null) {
  const payload = {
    messaging_product: "whatsapp",
    recipient_type: "individual",
    to: phoneNumber,
    type: mediaUrl ? "image" : "text",
  };

  if (mediaUrl) {
    payload.image = { link: mediaUrl };
  } else {
    payload.text = { preview_url: false, body: message };
  }

  const response = await axios.post(
    `https://graph.instagram.com/v18.0/${PHONE_NUMBER_ID}/messages`,
    payload,
    {
      headers: {
        Authorization: `Bearer ${ACCESS_TOKEN}`,
        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
      }
    }
  );

  return response.data;
}
```

### 3. Inbox Management
```javascript
app.get('/api/conversations/:phoneNumber/messages', async (req, res) => {
  const messages = await db.collection('messages')
    .find({ 'participant.phoneNumber': req.params.phoneNumber })
    .sort({ timestamp: -1 })
    .limit(50)
    .toArray();

  res.json(messages);
});
```

## Overview
Payment gateway integration using Razorpay APIs for accepting online payments. Handles payment processing, order creation, and webhook callbacks.

## Tech Stack
